### 1) Generate API key
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/keys/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "smoke"
}

### 2) Import URI (replace X-API-Key)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/totp/import-uri
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: REPLACE_ME

{
  "otpauth_uri": "otpauth://totp/GitHub:alice@example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=GitHub&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30"
}

### 3) Query code by unique id
GET http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/totp/code/a1b2c3d4
X-API-Key: REPLACE_ME

### 4) Code from URI (one-time, no persist)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/totp/code-from-uri
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: REPLACE_ME

{
  "otpauth_uri": "otpauth://totp/GitHub:alice@example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=GitHub"
}

### 5) Code from URI (persist with email)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/totp/code-from-uri
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: REPLACE_ME

{
  "otpauth_uri": "otpauth://totp/GitHub:alice@example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=GitHub",
  "email": "alice@example.com"
}
